# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository so a fresh clone is
# byte-identical on every platform. Windows tooling that needs CRLF converts on
# checkout.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf

CMakeLists.txt text
*.cmake text
*.cmake.in text
*.hpp text
*.cpp text
*.cu text
*.md text
LICENSE text
